00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:40.820
Can it be?!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.110
Indeed.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.740
<i>The dark miasma infesting
the Cloud Continent.</i>

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.080
<i>The remnant of the darkness
