00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.020
Time of completion.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.690
Time of completion.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.150
Time of completion.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.830
Taichi...

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.670
Gabumon.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.790
Can you fight?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.470
Koshiro!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.590
Sora!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.920
Let's go...

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.720
stop them!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.900
You guys stay here to protect Patamon
