00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.020
Got it?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.480
Please watch over Hikari-chan.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.530
Okay...

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.540
Birdramon, are you okay?

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.540
Yes...

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.500
Taichi-san!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.040
Koshiro-san...

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.440
Let's hurry!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.810
We're gonna destroy it
before Millenniumon revives!

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.300
-Yeah!
-Okay!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:22.440
I'm sorry. Even though Lilimon can fly...

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:26.490
It's okay. Don't push yourself
and get some rest for now.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.840
Komondomon, please...

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:43.670
Let's go back. Take me to Taichi!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.760
Please, Komondomon!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.340
Hikari-chan.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:56.230
Hikari-kun, Komondomon is hurt too.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:58.270
Let's not push Komondomon.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:03.860
T-Tailmon!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.480
Hikari...

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.990
Thank goodness.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:12.870
Hikari?

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:16.990
Tailmon...

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.370
Hikari.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:23.080
Taichi and Agumon were...

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.890
Something's coming!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.110
GRIFFOMON

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.910
Griffomon... a Mega Digimon!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.670
Koshiro, Sora, go on ahead!

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.370
-Okay!
-Alright!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.670
Metalgarurumon!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:06.920
Yeah!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.640
At this rate,
Millenniumon will be revived.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:26.940
If that happens,
we won't stand a chance in our state now.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:33.450
But... what do I do at a time like this?

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.030
What am I supposed to do?

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.080
Joe...

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.460
Gomamon, you still need to rest!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:52.720
Joe... please let me evolve.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:53.840
What?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.760
That way, we can get back
to the other side.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:03.310
Taichi and Agumon... stayed behind for us.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.770
I can't just sit still, Joe.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.230
Gomamon!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.370
Komondomon?

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.260
Flowers?

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:37.130
But why flowers?

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.100
They probably got stuck
when we were running from Mugendramon.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:50.480
Komondomon...
are you trying to cheer us up?

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.740
That's really nice of you.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.030
Patamon?!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.780
Takeru?

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.490
Patamon!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.510
What is that?

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.730
Meteor Wing!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:27.620
Yeah...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.670
I want to think... they're safe too.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.420
I want to believe that.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.960
But it was such a big explosion.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.170
Of course you'd be worried.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.220
That's normal.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.120
Oh.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.710
Are you trying to make something?

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:19.220
A corsage... or trying to.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.970
A corsage?

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:22.930
A decoration made from flowers.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.180
You wear them on your head or chest.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.380
Garuru Tomahawk!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:26.200
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.210
Garudamon!

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:40.090
Kabuterimon Super Evolution!

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:50.220
Atlurkabuterimon!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.810
Shadow Wing!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.730
Horn Buster!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.290
Taichi...

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.440
<i>Hikari-chan....</i>

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.230
<i>Um... hey...</i>

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:47.280
Won't you tell me?

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:54.790
You have a lot of
fun memories of the past, right?

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.870
What?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.000
Of you...

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.000
and Taichi-san.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.880
Like your birthdays.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.640
And Christmas or New Year's.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.810
Just lots and lots of memories!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:40.040
Taichi-san sure smiles a lot.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:44.630
I like it when Taichi-san smiles.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:49.390
My grandpa usually has a stern face,

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.130
but his smiles are just lovely too.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.890
Maybe I like people who smile.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.020
<i>My grandpa used to say,</i>

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:05.070
<i>"When I'm with my beloved family
and very good friends,</i>

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:07.610
<i>it puts a smile on my face naturally."</i>

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.030
I'm...

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.450
I'm going to believe.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:21.160
Let's believe... that they're safe!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.180
Hikari...

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:45.310
I believe it as well...
so you must too, Hikari.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.270
You're right.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.950
<i>They'll definitely come back!</i>

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.080
<i>I believe it too!</i>

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.870
<i>Yes, that's why we'll...</i>

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:04.960
Yamato.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.750
Yeah, let's believe.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.970
Taichi and Agumon
will definitely come back.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:13.220
That's why we'll move forward!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:16.970
Corsage.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.470
I'll make a corsage too.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.490
Now!

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:30.900
Alright!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:35.400
Grace Cross Freezer!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.500
Yamato!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.380
Keep shooting!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.130
-Okay!
-Alright!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.390
Grace Cross Freezer!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.310
It's finished.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.980
It's very pretty.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:51.060
Yeah.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.610
I'm gonna give this to Taichi!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.570
Mine's done too!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.610
This one's for Agumon!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:03.540
Where do you put that thing on?

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.420
"Where?" On your chest of course!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:07.710
What?!

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:41.780
Now rise...

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.910
Millenniumon!

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.740
Millenniumon!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.790
Millenniumon!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.790
Millenniumon!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.170
Millenniumon!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.140
MILLENNIUMON

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.530
So that's...

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.080
Millenniumon!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.890
We couldn't stop it...

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.140
But!

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.790
Taichi...

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.670
Taichi!

